<%--
Ejc_Full_Own - a FULL template (markup of its own, no slots). Its class extends
Ejc_Grid_B and extends="Ejc_Grid_B" agrees, so there is no conflict: its own markup
renders and neither parent's markup does.
--%>
<Define:Ejc_Full_Own extends="Ejc_Grid_B">
  <div class="ejc-own-marker">OWN</div>
</Define:Ejc_Full_Own>
